OL,3,GNEWSA'Dangerously ill' son killed
OL,4,Amother in her own home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dangerously ill" man who bludgeoned
OL,7,Fhis mother to death has been sent to a
OL,8,Fsecure hospital indefinitely.
OL,10,FGraham Daly, 45, who has a psychotic
OL,11,Fdisorder, attacked 70-year-old Phyllis
OL,12,FDaly at her home in Clent Road,
OL,13,FMaghull, on 13 July 2025.
OL,15,FLiverpool Crown Court heard he had been
OL,16,Fliving with his parents, Phyllis and
OL,17,FDavid Daly, at the time of the attack.
OL,19,FDaly, who had originally been charged
OL,20,Fwith murder, pleaded guilty to
OL,21,Fmanslaughter by reason of diminished
OL,22,Fresponsibility.
